{"abstract":"This paper reports on an on-going research project called ‘The Augmented City’ which aims to create augmented reality (AR) experiences in the city of Helsingør. The paper describes and discusses two ‘sensitising workshops’ intended to promote bodily, affective, and ecologically aware ways of relating to our urban surroundings.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Ryding, Karin","Jørgensen, Stina Hasse","Tsaknaki, Vasiliki"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-384981"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Augmented Reality Design methodology Affective encounters Soma More than human"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"sensing places making room for more than human encounters in the city","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.scienceopen.com/hosted-document?doi=10.14236/ewic/POM2021.44","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-384981","ids":["itu-fc7d5cae-f71d-4bad-817d-12f73c896940"],"keyword":["Augmented Reality, Design methodology, Affective encounters, Soma, More-than-human"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-833E08ED5364A970CB6B985019A6B2B4"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.scienceopen.com/hosted-document?doi=10.14236/ewic/POM2021.44","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT","IT University of Copenhagen, Human-Computer 